"secondary_5", "content": "Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Talking About People's Personalities"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use adjectives to describe a person's personality: how a person acts or behaves."}, {"type": "text", "content": "The word <span class = \"strong\">very</span> shows how funny Peter is. Peter is very funny."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":\"7\",\"columns\":\"2\",\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"strong\\\">Adjective</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"strong\\\">Description</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"brave\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"a person who isn't afraid of danger\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"generous\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"a person who shares things with others\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"rude\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"a person with bad manners\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"funny\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"a person who makes people laugh\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"quiet\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"a person who doesn't talk very much\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"nice\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"a person who is kind to others\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Peter is very nice."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Sally is not a quiet person."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use the Simple Present tense of the verb <span class = \"strong\">to be</span> when you describe personality."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Form:      subject   +  to  be      + adjective <br /> Example: <span class=\"italic\">Peter is a nice person.</span>"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you hear in conversations about people."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "nice"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "friendly, kind to others"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Peter is a nice person."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le02ob04aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "smart"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to be clever; intelligent"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: He is smart and very funny."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le02ob04aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "boring"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "not interesting"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Peter is in my boring Business class."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le02ob04aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "person"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "an individual"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: She is a nice person."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le02ob04aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "people"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the plural form of person (more than one person)"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Does he like people?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le02ob04aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "business"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the study of money and trade"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Peter is in my business class."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le02ob04aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "a little"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a small amount"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I am a little embarrassed!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le02ob04aud08"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "very"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "extra; additional"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adverb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Peter is very funny."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le02ob04aud09"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "slim"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "not overweight; thin"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Is he slim?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le02ob04aud10"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "fit"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "healthy and active"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Peter is a fit person."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le02ob04aud11"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn2le02ob04re1img01.png"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Choose 2 or 3 family members."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write 1 sentence for each person about their personality. Use one of these words: <span class=\"italic\">boring</span>, <span class=\"italic\">smart</span>, <span class=\"italic\">nice</span>, <span class=\"italic\">funny</span>."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write 1 sentence giving personal information. Use one of these words: <span class=\"italic\">slim</span>, <span class=\"italic\">fit</span>, <span class=\"italic\">very</span>, <span class=\"italic\">a little</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Find a new adjective in a dictionary to describe a person. Write 1 sentence using this adjective."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read your sentences to a partner."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I describe people's personalities."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write descriptive sentences about personalities."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I identify new descriptive adjectives in a dictionary."}]}], "type": "sena"}